    58	Quota refusal, proxy refusal, readiness transition, shutdown start, and shutdown completion are
    59	append-only audited without raw addresses or credentials. Quota counters are operational abuse
    60	state and may reset on process restart; command/session/idempotency truth remains durable and is not
